  m_text: "\"Ah, those street vendors by the shrine, the smell of grilled chicken
    still lingers in my memory.\"\n\n\"They'd squeeze calamansi over the meat, brush
    it with soy sauce mixed with garlic and sugar.\"\n\n\"Skewered and grilled until
    glossy brown\u2026 we made our own version later on, too.\""
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 63e86bfcd2913ed40bbabfa03747da14, type: 2}
